      "comment": "ZIPPING MEARES (7) hit the ground running off an inside draw last start and was never headed (27.87) at Bendigo in a Maiden over 500m. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Great chance again. EXCITED TWITCH (3) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (29.97) at this track over 515m. Expected to be in the finish again. WE CAN (4) was a course and distance placegetter (29.94) last time also from the same draw, finishing a 1.2 lengths second in a Mix 6/7. Harder here but expected to measure up. BLIZZARD BYRNE (2) has definite claims at his first try at this circuit.",
